<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>VidyaSetu — Features (section preview)</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link
        href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap"
        rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/learnM.css">
</head>

<body>

    <!-- Drop this <section> into your page where "Features" should sit.
     Make sure features.css is linked in your <head>, or merge its
     rules into your main stylesheet. Classes are prefixed "vs-" so
     they won't clash with the rest of vidyasetu.com -->

    <section id="features">
        <div class="vs-feat-head">
            <div class="vs-badge"><span class="dot"></span>Features</div>
            <h2>Skills in. <span>Right opportunities out.</span></h2>
            <p>VidyaSetu doesn't just list jobs — it works out exactly where you fit, and exactly what's missing when
                you don't.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- SPOTLIGHT: bidirectional skill <-> job matching -->
        <div class="vs-spotlight">
            <div class="vs-spotlight-text">
                <span class="vs-spotlight-tag">Core Feature</span>
                <h3>Skill-to-Job Matching, both directions</h3>
                <p>Tell us your skills and we'll show you the jobs you're already fit for. Pick a job you want, and
                    we'll show you exactly which skills you still need to get there.</p>
                <div class="vs-spotlight-list">
                    <div><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"
                            stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5" />
                        </svg> Skills → Jobs: see roles ranked by how well you already match</div>
                    <div><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"
                            stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5" />
                        </svg> Job → Skills: pick a target role, get the exact skill gap to close</div>
                    <div><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"
                            stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5" />
                        </svg> Every gap links straight to a course or program that fixes it</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="vs-spotlight-fig">
                <div class="vs-fig-card">
                    <div class="lbl">Your skills → matched job</div>
                    <div class="vs-fig-row">
                        <div class="vs-fig-name">React</div>
                        <div class="vs-fig-track">
                            <div class="vs-fig-fill" style="width:88%"></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="vs-fig-val">88%</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="vs-fig-row">
                        <div class="vs-fig-name">SQL</div>
                        <div class="vs-fig-track">
                            <div class="vs-fig-fill" style="width:74%"></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="vs-fig-val">74%</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="vs-fig-row">
                        <div class="vs-fig-name">Git</div>
                        <div class="vs-fig-track">
                            <div class="vs-fig-fill" style="width:81%"></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="vs-fig-val">81%</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="vs-fig-arrow">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"
                        stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <path d="M12 5v14M19 12l-7 7-7-7" />
                    </svg>
                    Frontend Intern — 91% match
                </div>
                <div class="vs-fig-card">
                    <div class="lbl">Target job → skills you still need</div>
                    <div class="vs-fig-row">
                        <div class="vs-fig-name">Cloud (AWS)</div>
                        <div class="vs-fig-track">
                            <div class="vs-fig-fill low" style="width:32%"></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="vs-fig-val">32%</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="vs-fig-row">
                        <div class="vs-fig-name">System Design</div>
                        <div class="vs-fig-track">
                            <div class="vs-fig-fill low" style="width:40%"></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="vs-fig-val">40%</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- FEATURE GRID -->
        <div class="vs-feat-grid" style="margin-top:22px;">

            <div class="vs-feat-card">
                <div class="vs-feat-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"
                        stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <path d="M8 21h8M12 17v4M17 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a7 7 0 0 0 14 0V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z" />
                    </svg></div>
                <h4>Hackathons &amp; Innovation Challenges</h4>
                <p>Company-sponsored hackathons hosted right inside VidyaSetu — build real projects, get scored, and
                    land on a recruiter's shortlist before you even apply.</p>
                <span class="vs-feat-pill">New</span>
            </div>

            <div class="vs-feat-card">
                <div class="vs-feat-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"
                        stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <path d="M23 7l-7 5 7 5V7z" />
                        <rect x="1" y="5" width="15" height="14" rx="2" />
                    </svg></div>
                <h4>Live Video Sessions</h4>
                <p>Live mentorship, guest lectures and mock interviews streamed directly on the platform — join from
                    your dashboard, no external links.</p>
                <span class="vs-feat-pill">New</span>
            </div>

            <div class="vs-feat-card">
                <div class="vs-feat-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"
                        stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14" />
                        <path d="M22 4L12 14.01l-3-3" />
                    </svg></div>
                <h4>Skill Gap Analysis</h4>
                <p>A clear, visual breakdown of where you stand versus where the industry needs you to be — updated
                    every time you retake your assessment.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="vs-feat-card">
                <div class="vs-feat-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"
                        stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <path d="M20 7h-9M14 17H5M6 3v4M9 4H5M20 17v4M22 19h-4" />
                    </svg></div>
                <h4>Internship &amp; Placement Tracking</h4>
                <p>Apply, track application status, and follow your placement journey end-to-end — no more spreadsheets
                    or scattered emails.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="vs-feat-card">
                <div class="vs-feat-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"
                        stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2" />
                        <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4" />
                    </svg></div>
                <h4>Verified Digital Portfolio</h4>
                <p>Projects, certifications and achievements verified by mentors or issuing companies — one link you can
                    share with any recruiter.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="vs-feat-card">
                <div class="vs-feat-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"
                        stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <path d="M3 3v18h18M18 17V9M13 17V5M8 17v-3" />
                    </svg></div>
                <h4>Institution Analytics</h4>
                <p>Colleges get live dashboards on skill readiness, internship participation and placement rates,
                    department by department.</p>
            </div>

        </div>

        <!-- STATS -->
        <div class="vs-stats">
            <div>
                <div class="vs-stat-num"><span>92%</span></div>
                <div class="vs-stat-label">Avg. match accuracy</div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="vs-stat-num">150<span>+</span></div>
                <div class="vs-stat-label">Hackathons hosted</div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="vs-stat-num">300<span>+</span></div>
                <div class="vs-stat-label">Live sessions run</div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="vs-stat-num">2K<span>+</span></div>
                <div class="vs-stat-label">Skill gaps closed</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

</body>

</html>